@baseUrl = http://localhost:5156
@hrToken = replace-with-hr-or-admin-token
@regId = replace-with-registered-registration-id

### Normal sign in (HR/admin, server time, SCAN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/{{regId}}/signin
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

### Sign in again, expected 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/{{regId}}/signin
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

### Manual make-up sign in (HR/admin, MANUAL, remark required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "regId": {{regId}},
  "signinTime": "2026-08-27T09:30:00+08:00",
  "remark": "补签，会议冲突"
}

### Manual sign in without remark, expected 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "regId": {{regId}},
  "remark": ""
}

### Mark absent after course end (only REGISTERED, HR/admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/{{regId}}/absent
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

### Complete training after course end (only SIGNED_IN, HR/admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/{{regId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
